    <string name="ctl_soul_explain">SOUL.md is the core identity and personality of Hermes. It is read when a new session starts, so changes apply to new chats.</string>
    <string name="ctl_memory_explain">MEMORY.md is what Hermes has learned and decided to remember by itself: facts, lessons, habits. Each card is one entry. Edit, delete or add entries; Hermes reads them in new sessions.</string>
    <string name="ctl_user_explain">USER.md is what Hermes knows about you: your name, preferences, how you like answers. Keep it short and true.</string>
