    <string name="ctl_diag_summary">Copy or share a report</string>
    <string name="ctl_diag_explain">Creates a report of the app and the runtime to send when something goes wrong. Secrets are removed automatically. If a self-test is running, wait for it to finish first.</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_what">A pocket-sized home for AI agents: everything runs on your phone, only the language model is remote.</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_hermes_title">HERMES AGENT</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_hermes">Agirî runs Hermes Agent v0.23.3 by Nous Research (MIT licence). The agent\'s skills and memory are their work.</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_pet_title">PÊT, THE NEWT</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_pet">Pêt is a little Kurdistan newt, a salamander: the spirit that lives in fire. Its name means \"spark\" in Kurmanji. It keeps the Newroz fire burning while you work.</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_licences_title">LICENCES</string>
    <string name="ctl_about_licences">Includes open-source software and assets, each under its own licence: Hermes Agent (MIT), PRoot (GPL-2.0), Debian GNU/Linux, Python, sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0), Supertonic 3 (MIT / OpenRAIL-M, optional on-device download), and uisfx sound cues (CC0-1.0). Full texts are in the project repository.</string>
